        "answer": {
          "short": "$33$",
          "worked": "There are $100$ whole numbers from $0$ to $99$. Part a shows that $67$ are divisible by $2$ or $3$. The remaining numbers are divisible by neither.\n\n$$100-67=33.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
